    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Growing up in Mulko Wahan, a small village near Ranipur Sugar Mills in Khairpur District, Sindh, Nooreen Aziz felt the weight of inequality. It was clear to her from an early age that something had to change. She remembers sitting in class, watching the boys eagerly raise their hands while she was told to wait her turn.",
